    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家万圣节快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期万圣节特辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>我跟老董推荐了一些适合万圣节氛围的歌曲以及电影</span></p><span></span><p><span>从《Thriller》到《洛基恐怖秀》</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊得稍微有点杂，希望大家喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Michael Jackson - Thriller</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> Polo &amp; Pan - Abysse&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> WYS - The Mansion</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2139">35:39</a> Backstreet Boys - Everybody (Backstreet's Back)&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> Daniel Caesar - Moon (feat. Bon Iver)</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的电影电视剧：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《寻梦环游记》《洛基恐怖秀》《剪刀手爱德华》《理发师陶德》《鸡皮疙瘩》《摩登家庭》《变相怪杰》《我和僵尸有个约会》《青蛇》</span></p>]]></description>
