  <item>
    <title>E.19 French Pop！是复古、是浪漫、还是自由 ？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fe55b1015672032122dabc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fe55b1015672032122dabc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 17:41:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>节目简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>从香颂到合成器，从抒情浪漫到电子律动——法国流行乐始终带着一种独特的优雅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们一起回望 French Pop 的发展脉络：从上世纪五六十年代的香颂黄金期，到六七十年代的yéyé，到 Jean-Michel Jarre 开启的电子浪潮，再到 90 年代的 “French Touch” 时代与当代新生代音乐人的复兴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目节目将带你听见法国流行乐如何在半个世纪的时间里，把“浪漫”与“未来”这两个看似矛盾的词，揉合成世界乐坛上最具辨识度的声音。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期重点内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>法国流行乐的历史脉络：从香颂到电子浪潮：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> &nbsp;</span></strong><span>开头概述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> 香颂时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> Yéyé时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1011">16:51</a> 全面开花的过渡阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1011">16:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> “French Touch”来临</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> Jean-Michel Jarre 如何奠定法国电子乐的基础</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2106">35:06</a> Daft Punk缔造“法国电音”名品</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期推荐的歌手及歌曲介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2106">35:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">42:23</a> L’Impératrice – </span><em><span>Hématome</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">42:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2847">47:27</a> Angèle – </span><em><span>Libre</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2847">47:27</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3579">59:39</a> Polo &amp; Pan – </span><em><span>Pareidolies</span></em><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>结语：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3580">59:40</a> 唠一唠French Pop的创作基因及美学</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong><span>（按时间线）：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Bon Entendeur, Isabelle Pierre - </span><em><span>Le temps est bon</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a></span><em><span> </span></em><span>Edith Piaf</span><em><span> - La Vie En Rose&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> </span></em><span>Edith Piaf</span><em><span> - Non, Je Ne Regrette Rien&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> </span></em><span>Elvis Presley</span><em><span> - Jailhouse Rock&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a> </span></em><span>Gilbert Becaud </span><em><span>- Salut Les Copains &nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> </span></em><span>Sheila </span><em><span>- Papa t'es plus dans l'coup&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> </span></em><span>Françoise Hardy</span><em><span> - Comment te dire adieu&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> </span></em><span>Dalida </span><em><span>- Laisser-moi danser&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> </span></em><span>Air</span><em><span> - Sexy Boy</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">19:03</a> </span></em><span>Jean Michel Jarre</span><em><span> - Oxygène, Pt. 4 &nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">22:04</a> </span></em><span>Jean Michel Jarre - </span><em><span>Oxygène</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1628">27:08</a> Daft Punk - </span><em><span>Da Funk</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> Daft Punk - </span><em><span>Something About Us</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入听友群（简介下方）参与互动，与大家共同分享关于音乐的点滴。</span></p>]]></description>
