    <guid isPermaLink="false">68baff0397178f08ee7a4cf9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Sep 2025 15:43:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>秋天是个迷人的季节。</span></p><span></span><p><span>它包包裹着温暖、热情、燥热、悲伤、消沉等；一点点扭曲，一点点张力，一点点的情绪波动。它是复杂的，难以体会的，充满希望的，也是近乡情怯的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>秋天是个令人消沉的季节。</span></p><span></span><p><span>突然的寒凉拂过脸颊，好像错过什么，但它正在发生，正在流淌，正在逝去……</span></p><span></span><p><span>这就是秋天，我们将有“秋天”元素的歌曲分享给你，希望可以与我们一起体验者复杂的、安静的、悠长的季节。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;Si tu vois ma mère —— Sidney Joseph Bechet</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> &nbsp;Les feuilles mortes —— Yves Montand</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> Hangang Gongwon —— BIBI</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> &nbsp;Autumn in New York —— Ella Fitzgerald, Louis Armstrong</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">35:13</a> My Little Brown Book —— Duke Ellington &amp; John Coltrane&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 秋意浓 —— 张学友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a> Four Seasons —— TAEYEON</span></p>]]></description>
